# Base path (or URL) of the PlateVision API, baked into the bundle at BUILD time.
#
# Leave unset for a self-hosted single-process deploy: FastAPI serves this bundle
# itself, so requests go to the same origin at the root. That is what
# `npm run build` targets, and it is the default.
#
# The Vercel deploy uses `.env.vercel` (applied by `npm run build:vercel` via
# `--mode vercel`), which points VITE_API_BASE at the backend's absolute URL --
# the backend runs on a separate container host (see DEPLOYMENT.md), not on Vercel.
#
# Set it here only when the API lives on a DIFFERENT origin. No trailing slash.
# The API must then also list this UI's origin in its own CORS_ORIGINS, and its
# API_PREFIX must match whatever path portion appears here (empty by default).
#VITE_API_BASE=https://api.example.com
